$DATUM (1-Formyl-4-methoxy-6,7-dihydro-5aH-dibenzofuran-9a-yl)-acetic acid ethyl
ester 85 To a test tube was added aryl ether 90 (154mg, 0.39mmol),
Pd(OAc)2 (9mg, 0.039mmol), Ag2CO3 (321mg, 1.16mmol) and dppp (25mg,
0.06mmol). The test tube was evacuated and filled with argon (3x).
Degassed toluene (3mL) was added into the test tube. The solution was
heated at 107°C for 12 h. The resulting solution was directly subjected
to chromatography (pet ether/ diethyl ether=2:1) to give a colorless
liquid (101mg, 82%). colorless liquid. IR(film) 3444, 3357, 2930, 2841,
2732, 1728, 1688, 1608, 1571, 1505, 1436, 1284, 1170, 1112, 1028, 917,
800, 764 cm-1. 1H NMR (300MHz, CDCl3) δ 9.80 (s, 1H), 7.30 (d, J=8.4Hz,
1H), 6.85 (d, J=8.7Hz, 1H), 6.05 (m, 1H), 5.83 (m, 1H), 5.13 (m, 1H),
3.95 (q, J=7.2Hz, 2H), 3.92 (s, 3H), 3.38 (d, J=15Hz, 1H), 2.82 (d,
J=15Hz, 1H), 2.35-2.10 (m, 2H), 2.10-1.80 (m, 2H), 1.06 (t, J=6.9Hz, 3H).
13C NMR (75MHz, CDCl3) δ 186.29, 166.06, 144.95, 143.75, 128.04, 125.48,
123.66, 123.46, 122.04, 105.34, 81.14, 55.40, 51.22, 43.75, 36.26, 18.85,
14.11, 9.22. HRMS: Calc’d for C18H20O5 (M+): 316.1311. Found: 316.1310.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
