$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-4-(perfluorophenyl)penta-2,4-dienamide (entry 6).
Lithium chloride (10.0 mg, 0.24 mmol), HBF4P(t-Bu)3 (7.0 mg, 0.024 mmol),
1-(perfluorophenyl)vinyl diphenyl pho-sphate (156.0 mg, 0.35 mmol),
N-tert-butyl acrylamide (30.0 mg, 0.24 mmol), Cy2NMe (102 μL, 0.48 mmol),
PdCl2(COD) (3.4 mg, 0.012 mmol) dissolved in DMF (2 mL) were reacted for
24 h at 80°C. The crude product was purified by flash chromatography on
silica gel using EtOAc:Pentane (1:10) as eluent. This afforded 62.2 mg of
the title compound (81 % yield) as a colorless solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CD3CN) δ (ppm) 7.30 (d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 6.14 (bs, 1H, NH), 6.04 (d, 1H,
J = 0.4 Hz), 5.59 (s, 1H), 5.58 (dd, 1H, J = 14.8 Hz, 0.4 Hz), 1.29 (s,
9H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, C6D6-CD3CN (1:1)) δ (ppm) 164.3, 137.7, 132.6,
128.2, 127.0, 51.0, 28.2. 19F NMR (376 MHz, CD3CN) δ (ppm) -164.7 (dt, J
= 21.1 Hz, 6.8 Hz), -158.1 (t, J = 20.0 Hz), -142.9 (dd, 1H, J = 21.5 Hz,
6.8 Hz). HRMS C15H14F5NO [M+H+]: 320.1074 found: 320.1086.
