$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-4-o-tolylpenta-2,4-dienamide (entry 9). Lithium chloride
(17 mg, 0.40 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol), diphenyl 1-o-tolylvinyl
phosphate (190.5 mg, 0.52 mmol), N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40
mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol), PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol)
dissolved in DMF (3 mL) were reacted for 24 h at 80°C. The crude product
was purified by flash chromatography on silica gel using CH2Cl2 as
eluent. This afforded 74.5 mg of the title compound (80 % yield) as a
colorless solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, C6D6) δ (ppm) 7.79 (d, 1H, J = 15.2
Hz), 7.77 (m, 5H), 5.40 (d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 5.34 (m, 1H), 5.01 (d, 1H,
J = 2.0 Hz), 4.55 (bs, 1H, NH), 2.10 (s, 3H), 1.15 (s, 9H). 13C NMR (100
MHz, C6D6) δ (ppm) 164.5, 147.0, 142.2, 139.9, 136.1, 130.4, 129.8,
128.0, 126.1, 125.9, 123.8, 50.9, 28.7, 19.7. HRMS C16H21NO [M+Na+]:
266.1521 found: 266.1521.
