$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: (13) General procedure: A 100 mL Schlenk flask
was charged with base, NMP, alkene, ArX, H2O, and a solution of 2a in
NMP, under N2 atmosphere. The mixture was stirred and introduced in a
preheated oil bath at the reaction temperature. The reaction was
monitored by 19F NMR. When it was complete, the mixture was cooled.
Compound no:6, time:7h, 80% yield.
