$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: iii) Procedures for the synthesis of product
3. 0.2 mmol (1 equiv) N-vinylacetamide 1, 10 mol% (0.02 mmol, 4.5 mg)
palladium (II)acetate and 10 mol% (0.02 mmol, 6.0 mg) Johnphos, 0.24 mmol
Na2CO3 ( 25.4 mg, 1.2 equiv) and 0.2 mmol tetrabutylammonium chloride
(55.8 mg, 1.0 equiv.) were dissolved in 2 mL of dry DMF in a screw cap
vial under argon atmosphere. The vial was heated at 120 °C under argon
atmosphere for 24 h. Then the solution was cooled to room temperature and
diluted with EA, washed by saturated ammonium chloride solution and
brine. The organic layer was dried with anhydrous NaSO4 and filtered. The
final filtrate was concentrated under vacuum to afford the crude product
which was isolated through flash column chromatography (Eluent: petrol
ether/ethylacetate) to give the desired product 3. 1-(11b-methyl-2,
11b-dihydro-1H-benzo [5, 6] indeno [1,2,3-cd]isoindol-1-yl)ethanone 1H
NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 8.69 (s, 1H), 7.88 (s, 1H), 7.83-7.80 (m, 1H),
7.74-7.72 (m, 1H), 7.44 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1H), 7.36 (dd, J = 6.1, 3.2 Hz,
2H), 7.26-7.22 (m, 1H), 6.98 (d, J = 7.4 Hz, 1H), 5.17 (d, J = 13.4 Hz,
1H), 4.61 (d, J = 13.5 Hz, 1H), 2.06 (s, 3H), 1.77 (s, 3H). 13C NMR (100
MHz, CDCl3): δ 170.06, 159.57, 148.91, 140.93, 137.61, 134.34, 133.63,
132.98, 130.54, 129.08, 128.41, 127.91, 126.30, 126.06, 121.55, 120.83,
120.10, 74.02, 57.62, 25.17, 22.98. HRMS (ESI): m/z calculated for
C21H18NO [M+H]+:300.1388 found: 300.1389.
