$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-4-(naphthalen-1-yl) penta-2,4-dienamide (entry 11).
Lithium chloride (17.4 mg, 0.40 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol),
1-(naphthalen-1-yl)vinyl diphenyl phosphate (241.4 mg, 0.60 mmol),
N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40 mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol),
PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol) dissolved in DMF (3 mL) were reacted for
24 h at 100°C. The crude product was purified by flash chromatography on
silica gel using CH2Cl2:ethyl acetate (99:1) as eluent. This afforded
88.2 mg of the title compound (79 % yield) as a white solid. 1H NMR (400
MHz, C6D6) δ (ppm) 7.70-7.67 (m, 1H), 7.64-7.62 (m, 1H), 7.58 (d, 1H, J =
14.8 Hz), 7.27-7.11 (m, 5H), 5.62 (m, 1H), 5.44 (s, 1H), 5.33 (d, 1H, J =
15.2 Hz), 5.15 (d, 1H, J = 2.0 Hz), 1.06 (s, 9H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, C6D6)
δ (ppm) 164.8, 146.2, 141.7, 137.8, 134.0, 132.0, 128.4, 128.1, 127.0,
126.9, 126.5, 126.3, 126.2, 125.7, 124.7, 50.9, 28.4. HRMS C19H21NO
[M+Na+]: 302.1521 found: 302.1523.
