Bromides under Mild Conditions
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Littke, Adam F.; Fu, Gregory C.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2001), 123(29), 6989-7000

