$DATUM A solution of 16 (24.4 mg, 0.074 mmol) in 1,4-dioxane (0.8 ml) in a
schlenk tube was added PdCl2 (1.3 mg, 10 mol %), PPh3 (3.9 mg, 20 mol%),
Cs2CO3 (60 mg, 0.184 mmol, 2.5 eq), norbornene (42 mg, 0.442 mmol, 6.0
eq), 8a (89 mg, 0.442 mmol, 6.0 eq). The mixture was stirred at 85°C for
20 h before being cooled to room temperature. The mixture was filtered
through a plug of silica gel eluting with ethyl acetate (20 ml). The
filtrate was concentrated and the residue was purified by column
chromatography (10% ethyl acetate/ hexanes and 50% hexanes/
dichloromethane). 21 (18.4 mg, 77%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 9.45 (s, 1
H), 7.83 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1 H), 7.58-7.36 (m, 3 H), 6.82 (s, 1 H), 5.77
(dd, J = 17.2, 9.3 Hz, 1 H), 5.07 (bd, J = 9.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.73 (bd, J =
14.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.67 (d, J = 17.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.20-3.96 (m, 1 H), 2.14-1.97
(m, 1 H), 1.97-1.86 (m, 1 H), 1.86-1.75 (m, 1 H), 1.65-1.46 (m, 2 H),
1.46-1.32 (m, 1 H), 0.71 (t, J = 7.6 Hz, 3 H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ
178.9, 150.0, 143.7, 140.6, 133.7, 131.3, 130.2, 128.2, 126.3, 123.9,
117.9, 114.8, 46.1, 43.4, 30.1, 29.4, 18.3, 8.1; HRMS (ACPI) calcd for
C19H21O3N2 [M++H] 325.1547, found 325.1554.
