$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Iodide anti-9a (0.171 g, 0.50 mmol) was
reacted according to the general radical procedure, with General
procedure for radical reactions: To a stirred PhH solution of the
appropriate substrate (1.0 equiv) at room temperature, open to the
atmosphere, was added Bu3SnH (1.5 equiv) all at once. The initial hydride
concentration [Bu3SnH]i is detailed for each individual reaction. A 1.0 M
hexanes solution of Et3B (1.0 equiv) was added all at once, and the
reaction was stirred until the starting material was completely consumed
(usually &lt; 5 min). The reaction mixture was concentrated by rotary
evaporation, and the crude residue was directly chromatographed on 10%
w/w KF/silica gel,6 using the appropriate eluent. Iodide anti-9a (0.171
g, 0.50 mmol) was reacted according to the general radical procedure,
with [Bu3SnH]i = 0.83 M. Column chromatography (3:2 hexanes:EtOAc) gave
the first eluting product, rac-N-(cyclohex-2-enyl)-N-phenylacetamide
(10a), as an orange oil (0.011 g, 10%).
rac-(3R,4aR,9aR)-9-Acetyl-6,8-dimethyl-2,3,4,4a,9,9a-hexahydro-1H-carbazol-3-yl
acetate (29t): Iodide syn-27t (0.107 g, 0.250 mmol) was reacted according
to the general radical procedure, with [Bu3SnH]i = 0.01 M. Column
chromatography (3:1 hexanes:EtOAc) provided the title compound (0.058 g,
77%) as a white solid. mp 134-136 °C, 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 6.89 (s,
1H), 6.87 (s, 1H), 4.56 (tt, J = 11.4 Hz, 3.6 Hz, 1H), 4.37 (br s, 1H),
3.69 (br m, 1H), 2.56 (m with clear d, J = 14.1 Hz, 1H), 2.32 (s, 3H),
2.24 (br s, 3H), 2.21 (s, 3H), 2.10-2.00 (m, 1H), 2.05 (s, 3H), 1.88 (dd,
J = 11.7 Hz, 6.0 Hz, 1H), 1.83 (dd, J = 11.7 Hz, 6.3 Hz, 1H), 1.53-1.23
(m, 2H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 170.4, 167.7 (br), 138.1, 135.6 (br),
135.3, 130.5, 129.3 (br), 120.7, 69.0, 62.3, 41.5, 29.9, 28.4, 25.9,
23.0, 21.3, 21.0, 20.0; FTIR (thin film, CHCl3, cm-1) 2944, 2865, 1732,
1665, 1412, 1379, 1244, 1038, 754; LRMS (EI) m/z 301 (M+, 36), 259 (29),
256 (15), 199 (15), 158 (40), 81 (100); HRMS (ESI) calcd for C18H23NNaO3
[M + Na]+: 324.1576, found: 324.1575.
