$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for Stille Coupling:
Preparation of Trifluoromethanesulfonic Acid
2-[Benzyl-(4-methoxy-2-phenylbut-2-enoyl)-amino]phenyl Ester (10). A
stirred mixture of Pd2dba3·CHCl3 (6 mg, 0.006 mmol), P(2-furyl)3 (12 mg,
0.051 mmol), and freshly distilled N-methylpyyrolidinone (NMP, 2 mL) was
deoxygenated by bubbling Ar through a submerged needle for 1 h, during
which time a bright yellow solution resulted. A deoxygenated solution of
stannane 9 (200 mg, 0.28 mmol), iodobenzene (52 mg, 0.25 mmol), and NMP
(5 mL) was then added via syringe. Copper(I) iodide (46 mg, 0.28 mmol)
was then added, and the resulting mixture was flushed with a stream of Ar
for 15 min and then maintained at room temperature for 24 h. After
diluting the reaction with EtOAc (100 mL), the resulting solution was
washed with 5% aqueous NH4OH (3 × 10 mL) and brine (3 × 10 mL). The
organic layer was dried (Na2SO4) and filtered, and the filtrate was
concentrated. The residue was purified by flash chromatography (1:9-3:7
EtOAc-hexanes). Trifluoromethanesulfonic acid
2-{benzyl-[2-(1-benzyl-3,3-dimethyl-2-oxo-2,3-dihydro-1H-indol-7-yl)-4-methoxybut-2-enoyl]amino}phenyl
ester (11k). The general procedure for the Stille coupling was followed
using stannane 9 (2.43 g, 3.39 mmol, 1.1 equiv),
1-benzyl-3,3-dimethyl-7-iodo-oxindole4 (1.16 g, 3.08 mmol),
Pd2(dba)3·CHCl3 (162 mg, 154 μmol, 5 mol%), P(2-furyl)3 (290 mg, 1.23
mmol, 0.4 equiv), and CuI (648 g, 3.39 mmol, 1.1 equiv) in NMP (15 mL).
The product was isolated by silica gel chromatography (EtOAc-hexanes,
2:8, v/v) to provide 11k (1.63 g, 75%) as a colorless solid. mp 133-134
°C; NMR spectra are complex due to slow rotation on the NMR timescale,
copies are included; IR (thin film) 2912, 1715, 1651, 1422, 1217 cm-1;
LRMS (ESMS) calcd for C36H33F3N3O6SNa (M+Na)+: 701; found: 701. Anal.
Calcd for C36H33F3N3O6S: C, 63.71; H, 4.90; N, 4.13. Found: C, 63.79; H,
4.95; N, 4.16.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM anaerobic, stereoselective, Stille coupling reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Catalytic Asymmetric Synthesis of Quaternary Carbons Bearing Two Aryl
Substituents. Enantioselective Synthesis of 3-Alkyl-3-Aryl Oxindoles by
Catalytic Asymmetric Intramolecular Heck Reactions
